cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Emotion Recognition from Movement: a Dual-Stream Transformer on 3D Pose and Laban Movement Analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Taoufiq"
    family-names: "T'Boubchat"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TaoufiQ-TbT/emotion-recognition-from-movement"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end system that recognizes six basic emotions (anger, disgust, fear,
  happiness, sadness, surprise) from monocular dance videos. A multi-pass
  MediaPipe pipeline extracts 3D poses, Laban Movement Analysis features are
  computed from them, and a dual-stream Transformer fuses both streams. Includes
  the full training pipeline and a web dashboard.
keywords:
  - emotion recognition
  - dance
  - human pose estimation
  - Laban Movement Analysis
  - transformer
  - MediaPipe
